# Data & Database
# Anchored to the repo root: this is for a local database/data dir, NOT for
# source folders. Unanchored, it silently swallowed src/app/.../settings/data/
# (the file existed locally, so builds and tests passed, but it was never
# committed and CI failed on the missing module).
/data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

